# Files stay byte for byte as they are, so a build from any clone matches the release on every system.
* -text

# Big files go in Git LFS: git keeps a small pointer, and Patch keeps the file.
# Other text files over 5 MB have to go there too, or pushes are refused: git lfs track "<file>".

